window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From an exciting new voice, a world dominated by vampires, threatened by malevolent witches...</p> <p>Sophie Devereaux embarks on a perilous quest to obtain an enchanted amulet with the power to eradicate the supernatural forces that hold humanity captive.</p> <p>As she navigates through a landscape of danger and intrigue, she must confront her deepest fears, make unthinkable sacrifices, and ultimately decide the fate of not only her people but also the supernatural beings that coexist with them, risking her own humanity as she does so.</p> <p>With its unique blend of romance, action, and the paranormal, Josephine’s Tear is sure to captivate listeners who crave an immersive and thrilling listen.</p>"; 
